<http://data.silknow.org/object/5d93f378-ce48-3bdb-81e5-7efcf5d46b45/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Fragment from the series \"The Story of the Holy Sacrament.\"Two scenes divided by tree with undulating trunk. On left: two drowning heretics; angels with chalice and host cloudborne above; tonsured priest and three townspeople on left bank; walled town in background. On the right: horse, ox, ass kneeing before host, bishop, clerics, townspeople, heretic surround; arch, holly tree, town at top. Dame Loyse le Roux arms at tree base; descriptive inscriptions below scenes. Condition: faded areas.  See related tapestries: 04.76, 1974.608 and 1974.610."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/5d93f378-ce48-3bdb-81e5-7efcf5d46b45> .

